# Patches must keep the line endings of the files they patch (LF in pcrecomp, FFNx, bgfx), and
# Git Bash scripts must stay LF: Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# check them out with CRLF (the bgfx patches then fail to apply on a fresh clone).
*.patch text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
